     The pptthhrreeaadd__ccoonndd__ttiimmeeddwwaaiitt() function will fail if:

     [EINVAL]           The value specified by _c_o_n_d, _m_u_t_e_x or _a_b_s_t_i_m_e is in‐
                        valid.

     [ETIMEDOUT]        The system time has reached or exceeded the time spec‐
                        ified in _a_b_s_t_i_m_e.

     [EPERM]            The specified _m_u_t_e_x was not locked by the calling
                        thread.

